      en:"CME Group, observation on FX options flow concentration around the London close and New York open. [See source](https://www.cmegroup.com/education/brochures-and-handbooks/cme-listed-fx-options-a-capital-efficient-low-cost-solution.html)",
      fr:"CME Group, observation sur la concentration du flux d'options FX autour de la clôture de Londres et de l'ouverture de New York. [Voir la source](https://www.cmegroup.com/education/brochures-and-handbooks/cme-listed-fx-options-a-capital-efficient-low-cost-solution.html)",
      de:"CME Group, Beobachtung zur Konzentration des FX-Optionsflusses rund um den Londoner Schluss und die New Yorker Eröffnung. [Quelle ansehen](https://www.cmegroup.com/education/brochures-and-handbooks/cme-listed-fx-options-a-capital-efficient-low-cost-solution.html)",
      it:"CME Group, osservazione sulla concentrazione del flusso di opzioni FX intorno alla chiusura di Londra e all'apertura di New York. [Vedi fonte](https://www.cmegroup.com/education/brochures-and-handbooks/cme-listed-fx-options-a-capital-efficient-low-cost-solution.html)",
